{"item_uid": "學測96-math-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設 f(x)=ax6 −bx4 +3x− 2，其中a, b 為非零實數，則 f(5)− f(−5)之值為\n(1) –30 (2) 0 (3) 2 2 (4) 30 (5) 無法確定(與a, b有關)", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 2.0, "2": 12.0, "3": 9.0, "4": 71.0, "5": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 0.0, "2": 3.0, "3": 1.0, "4": 95.0, "5": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 4.0, "2": 24.0, "3": 23.0, "4": 37.0, "5": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 71.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 37.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 91.0, 81.0, 60.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "試問共有多少個正整數n使得坐標平面上通過點A(−n, 0)與點B(0, 2)的直線亦通過點P(7, k)，\n其中k為某一正整數？\n(1) 2個\n(2) 4個\n(3) 6個\n(4) 8個\n(5) 無窮多個", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "2", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 15.0, "2": 35.0, "3": 15.0, "4": 4.0, "5": 30.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 13.0, "2": 58.0, "3": 5.0, "4": 2.0, "5": 22.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 16.0, "2": 19.0, "3": 25.0, "4": 8.0, "5": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 35.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 41.0, 28.0, 22.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設某沙漠地區某一段時間的溫度函數為 f(t)=−t2 +10t+11，其中1≤t≤10，則這段時間內該地\n區的最大溫差為\n(1) 9 (2) 16 (3) 20 (4) 25 (5) 36\nx2 y2 (x+1)2 y2", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 14.0, "2": 6.0, "3": 7.0, "4": 58.0, "5": 15.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 2.0, "2": 2.0, "3": 1.0, "4": 88.0, "5": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 26.0, "2": 13.0, "3": 17.0, "4": 24.0, "5": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 58.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 64.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 80.0, 64.0, 41.0, 16.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "坐標平面上方程式 + =1的圖形與 − =1的圖形共有幾個交點？\n9 4 16 9\n(1) 1個 (2) 2個 (3) 3個 (4) 4個 (5) 0個\n-1-\n96年學測 第2頁\n數學考科 共7頁\nx", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 47.0, "2": 20.0, "3": 10.0, "4": 9.0, "5": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 78.0, "2": 7.0, "3": 2.0, "4": 3.0, "5": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 17.0, "2": 31.0, "3": 21.0, "4": 15.0, "5": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 66.0, 46.0, 28.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "關於坐標平面上函數y =sinx的圖形和y= 的圖形之交點個數，下列哪一個選項是正確的？\n10π\n(1) 交點的個數是無窮多\n(2) 交點的個數是奇數且大於20\n(3) 交點的個數是奇數且小於20\n(4) 交點的個數是偶數且大於或等於20\n(5) 交點的個數是偶數且小於20\n貳 、 多 選 題 （ 佔 30 分 ）", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "3", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"1": 9.0, "2": 14.0, "3": 47.0, "4": 16.0, "5": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 3.0, "2": 11.0, "3": 67.0, "4": 8.0, "5": 11.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 15.0, "2": 18.0, "3": 28.0, "4": 26.0, "5": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 67.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 55.0, 46.0, 37.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若Γ={z|z為複數且 z−1 =1}，則下列哪些點會落在圖形Ω={w|w=iz,z∈Γ}上?\n(1) 2i (2) －2i (3) 1+i (4) 1－i (5) －1＋i", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,3,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 45.0, "2": 38.0, "3": 67.0, "4": 54.0, "5": 45.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 52.0, "2": 24.0, "3": 77.0, "4": 46.0, "5": 54.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 40.0, "2": 48.0, "3": 60.0, "4": 57.0, "5": 41.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 19.0, "p_high": 35.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [46.0, 16.0, 12.0, 11.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "坐標平面上有相異兩點P、Q，其中P點坐標為(s,t)。已知線段PQ的中垂線L的方程式為\n3x−4y=0，試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\n(cid:88)\n(1) 向量PQ與向量(3,−4)平行\n6s−8t\n(2) 線段PQ的長度等於\n5\n(3) Q點坐標為(t,s)\n(4) 過Q點與直線L平行之直線必過點(−s,−t)\n(cid:88) (cid:88) (cid:88)\n(5) 以O表示原點，則向量OP＋OQ與向量PQ的內積必為0\n- 2 -\n第3頁 96年學測\n共7頁 數學考科\n1 2 3 7\n ", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,2,4,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 57.0, "2": 64.0, "3": 30.0, "4": 59.0, "5": 64.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 71.0, "2": 78.0, "3": 12.0, "4": 61.0, "5": 73.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 49.0, "2": 53.0, "3": 46.0, "4": 55.0, "5": 55.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 25.0, "p_high": 42.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [51.0, 27.0, 20.0, 17.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪些選項中的矩陣經過一系列的列運算後可以化成0 1 1 2？\n 0 0 1 1 \n \n1 2 3 7 −1 3 −1 0 1 1 2 5\n     \n(1) 0 1 1 2 (2) −1 1 1 0 (3) 1 −1 1 2\n 0 2 3 5   3 1 −7 0   1 1 2 5 \n     \n 2 1 3 6 1 3 2 7\n   \n(4) −1 1 1 0 (5) 0 1 1 2\n −2 2 2 1   0 1 0 1 \n   ", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 70.0, "2": 39.0, "3": 45.0, "4": 31.0, "5": 59.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 88.0, "2": 40.0, "3": 43.0, "4": 20.0, "5": 64.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 51.0, "2": 41.0, "3": 49.0, "4": 40.0, "5": 55.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 30.0, "p_high": 36.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [38.0, 34.0, 31.0, 27.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "坐標空間中，在xy平面上置有三個半徑為1的球兩兩相切，設其球心分別為A,B,C。今將第四\n個半徑為1的球置於這三個球的上方，且與這三個球都相切，並保持穩定。設第四個球的球心\n為P，試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\n(1) 點A,B,C所在的平面和xy平面平行\n(2) 三角形ABC是一個正三角形\n(3) 三角形PAB有一邊長為 2\n(4) 點P到直線AB的距離為 3\n(5) 點P到xy平面的距離為1+ 3", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,2,4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 78.0, "2": 84.0, "3": 30.0, "4": 67.0, "5": 42.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 96.0, "2": 97.0, "3": 10.0, "4": 82.0, "5": 30.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 57.0, "2": 68.0, "3": 49.0, "4": 54.0, "5": 48.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 17.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [78.0, 54.0, 39.0, 26.0, 13.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設a為大於1的實數，考慮函數 f(x)= ax與g(x)= log x，試問下列哪些選項是正確的？\na\n(1) 若f(3) = 6，則g(36)=6\nf(238) f(38)\n(2) =\nf(219) f(19)\n(3) g(238)−g(219)= g(38)−g(19)\n(4) 若P, Q為y=g(x)的圖形上兩相異點，則直線PQ之斜率必為正數\n1\n(5) 若直線y=5x與y= f(x)的圖形有兩個交點，則直線y= x與y=g(x)的圖形也有兩個交點\n5\n-3-\n96年學測 第4頁\n數學考科 共7頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,2,4,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 57.0, "2": 69.0, "3": 35.0, "4": 73.0, "5": 54.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 80.0, "2": 85.0, "3": 14.0, "4": 87.0, "5": 55.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 38.0, "2": 54.0, "3": 53.0, "4": 59.0, "5": 53.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 28.0, "p_high": 52.0, "p_low": 11.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [61.0, 35.0, 22.0, 15.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測96-math-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設 f(x)為一實係數三次多項式且其最高次項係數為1，已知 f(1)=1, f(2)=2, f(5)=5，則\nf(x)=0在下列哪些區間必定有實根？\n(1) (–∞, 0) (2) (0, 1) (3) (1, 2) (4) (2, 5) (5) (5,∞)\n第 二 部 分 ： 選 填 題 （ 佔 45 分 ）", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "2,4", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 42.0, "2": 67.0, "3": 41.0, "4": 47.0, "5": 36.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 41.0, "2": 76.0, "3": 19.0, "4": 44.0, "5": 28.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 41.0, "2": 60.0, "3": 58.0, "4": 50.0, "5": 40.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 22.0, "p_high": 35.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [42.0, 22.0, 17.0, 15.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
